From b2cf6a68012b4d5e0fea951000162e853ee16260 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pavan S <psreenivas@habana.ai>
Date: Wed, 21 May 2025 08:17:05 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [FSW-9706] ipm: enhance ipm fs1 driver

This patch enhances the ipm_fs driver
to support exchanging message between
arcs. following supports are added
* psoc shared irq enable for rx.
* mbx_idx field is added to indentify, the
  SW mailbox index
* intr_mask field is added to unmask psoc interrupt
* Extended ipm_fs_mbx_regs fields as per the soconline

Signed-off-by: Pavan S <psreenivas@habana.ai>
Change-Id: I670017a1c3876b5913afc094e55595348c81269b
---

